  "description": "Certificate of Lawful Development Existing: Use of detached double garage as self-contained dwellinghouse",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The applicant has failed to provide sufficient evidence to demonstrate, on the balance of probabilities, the outbuilding has been in use as a self-contained residential unit for a continuous period of four years is accurate and indeed lawful and would not meet the requirements of S191(5) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The certificate is therefore NOT considered a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;"
